.subckt PL_shunt QH_S QL_D SH_out CapN CapP QH_D QL_S SH_in
* PL_shunt: Q3D AC partial inductance (nH) / resistance at 100MHz
* Copper only. Add MLCC ESL, EPC2361 package and shunt between the terminals.

R_AC QH_S AC_m 0.000570144
L_AC AC_m QL_D 0.0780508n
R_DCN SH_out DCN_m 0.00932949
L_DCN DCN_m CapN 0.50245n
R_DCP CapP DCP_m 0.000519995
L_DCP DCP_m QH_D 0.0599545n
R_SQL QL_S SQL_m 0.000330946
L_SQL SQL_m SH_in 0.0254691n
K_AC_DCN L_AC L_DCN -0.392212
K_AC_DCP L_AC L_DCP 0.012576
K_AC_SQL L_AC L_SQL 0.003346
K_DCN_DCP L_DCN L_DCP -0.353851
K_DCN_SQL L_DCN L_SQL -0.217678
K_DCP_SQL L_DCP L_SQL 0.001945
.ends PL_shunt
